#. Reviewed Swedish Thold notification template.
msgid ""
"This is the message that will be displayed at the top of all Threshold "
"Alerts (1024 Char MAX).  HTML is allowed, but will be removed for text only "
"Emails.  There are several common replacement tags that may be used in "
"include:<br>&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 "
"&#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 "
"&#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062  &#060URL&#062 "
"&#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060THOLD_ID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 "
"&#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062  &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 "
"&#60NOTES&#62 &#060DNOTES&#062"
msgstr ""
"Detta är texten som visas högst upp i alla tröskelvärdeslarm (högst 1024 "
"tecken). HTML är tillåtet men tas bort i e-postmeddelanden med enbart text. "
"Följande ersättningstaggar kan användas:<br>&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 "
"&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 "
"&#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062"
" &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060THOLD_ID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 "
"&#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 "
"&#60NOTES&#62 &#060DNOTES&#062"

